{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>將軍澳有人猝死。今日（21日）傍晚6時許，警方接獲一名婦人報案，其丈夫在佳景路9號浩明苑一單位內的房間昏迷。</p><p>救護員接報到場，經檢驗後，證實姓吳（50歲）事主當場死亡。警方將案件列「屍體發現」跟進，現正調查事件，稍後將驗屍確定其死因。據悉，吳男有身體病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"將軍澳浩明苑一名男住戶暈倒房內，當場不治。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189664594361061376298763.png/zcgazLnzs6mHBRV982EXBpdqfQAVtpDcTJPfKkyT3yo\"/><figcaption>將軍澳浩明苑一名男住戶暈倒房內，當場不治。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T12:00:29.115524+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:49:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:38:17.875564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:50.725763+00:00","content_hash":"e8a9f54b5312588fc307b808cb07d6c911eebd41e8620366b72e13335d736125","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}